 "note": "Standard '126 pinout (1OE 1, 1A 2, 1Y 3, 2OE 4, 2A 5, 2Y 6, GND 7, 3Y 8, 3A 9, 3OE 10, 4Y 11, 4A 12, 4OE 13, VCC 14), the same in every PDF and package: sn74hc126 p.3, cd74hc126 p.3 (D, N, J), cd74hct126 p.3, sn54bct126a p.1, sn64bct126a p.1, sn74abt126 p.1 (D/DB/N/NS/PW and RGY), sn74ac126 p.3 (PW, BQA), sn74act126 p.3, sn74ahc126 = sn54ahc126 p.3 (PW, BQA), sn74ahct126 p.3, sn74alvc126 p.1, sn74auc126 p.1 (RGY), sn74f126 p.1, sn74hcs126 p.3 (D, DYY, PW), sn74ls126a = sdls044a p.1 (SN74126 N and SN74LS126A D/N/NS; enables printed 1G..4G there, named 1OE..4OE here), sn74lv126a p.2, sn74lvc126a p.3 (D/DB/DGV/NS/PW, BQA/RGY), sn74lvth126 p.1, and the -Q1 PDFs p.3. RGY/BQA thermal pad is not a pin. Function table (OE H: Y = A; OE L: Z): sn74hc126 p.11, sn74auc126 p.1, sn74abt126 p.2.",
